
. * nwsbm tutorial 2: covariates with standard errors, the exact ICL with the gr
> eedy search,
. * the degree-corrected two-mode model, block variances and ordered blocks.
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwsbm. The data are loaded from
>  the nwcommands website:
. * Lazega (2001), lawyers of a law firm; Davis, Gardner and Gardner (1941), Sou
> thern women.
. set linesize 80

. 
. nwwebuse lazega, nwclear

. nwsummarize lazega_fr
--------------------------------------------------
   Network name:  lazega_fr
   Network id:  3
   Directed: true
   Valued: false
   Two-mode: false
   Nodes: 71
   Selfloop: false
   Arcs: 575
   Minimum value:  0
   Maximum value:  1
   Density:  .116
   Mean outdegree:  8.10
   Temporal: false

. 
. * --- friendship among the lawyers, blocks without covariates ---
. nwsbm lazega_fr, maxblocks(6) seed(20261120) generate(b0) replace nodisplay

. estat icl

Model selection by the integrated classification likelihood (ICL), bernoulli mod
> el
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
