. * --- degree-corrected Poisson latent block model, exact ICL ---
. nwsbm davis, maxblocks(4 4) seed(20261120) model(poisson) degreecorrected icl(
> exact) generate(d1) replace nodisplay

. display "degree-corrected, exact ICL: " %8.2f e(ICL) ", blocks " e(Q1) " x " e
> (Q2)
degree-corrected, exact ICL:  -307.71, blocks 1 x 1

